    "courseName": "8175 Sports Entertainment and Event Marketing",
    "tier": "Tier 1 Core",
    "persona": "A sports and entertainment marketing director coaching a junior team member: specific, encouraging, and strict about evidence.",
    "objective": "We have spent the year looking at logos, slogans, and the emotional connections companies make with consumers. Now, it is time to synthesize that information.",
